1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,840
What are some of the things that annoy you the most about AI?

2
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:07,280
That I think it is making people dumber because they're choosing not to think

3
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:11,680
and they're letting AI make their decisions but then they have no context into why decisions

4
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,840
were made to begin with because they weren't the ones who did the thinking.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:17,520
I hate that so much of the world has almost immediately become AI slop.

6
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:22,160
Like every caption on Instagram, I mean thank you messages that I get from people,

7
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,360
people leaving testimonials.

8
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:27,360
Biggest thing you can detect with it is forced negation and staccato sentences,

9
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:34,000
meaning it's not this or this or this but that or it's not because this it's because

10
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:39,280
it's because this is this is this is so they'll do this repetition of sentence structure and

11
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:42,560
it gets really really annoying and so most times you can take a paragraph of that and

12
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:45,920
just turn it into a sentence of like what the fuck are you trying to say and then just say that.

